  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "大戲"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>丁&nbsp; &nbsp; 津</b></span></p><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tiānn-tiānn想起細漢時</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">廟口lóng ē做大戲</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊lóng叫阮　先去占一个位</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">穡頭若煞伊tsiah過--去</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有時看kah笑bi-bi</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有時看kah滴珠淚</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">猶原ē攑一枝葵扇</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">不時ia̍t tī阮ê身邊</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mā m̄知　伊是笑啥mi̍h</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊講囡仔人　m̄ bat代誌</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我m̄知　伊是哭啥mi̍h</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">伊講囡仔人　有耳無喙</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮ê阿媽　一本書to無讀--過</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">但是忠孝節義lóng ē-hiáu背</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有時tsūn食虧　mā免計較hiah濟</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">人若有恩情　愛囥tī心肝底</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮ê阿媽　付出所有ê一切</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Kan-na希望規家口仔ē-tàng做伙</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">日子khah艱苦　mā m̄ bat離開--過</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">哪tio̍h ke講話　愛囥tī心肝底</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">到如今　tsiah知笑啥貨</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">因為我是伊ê心肝寶貝</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tsit-má tsiah知　伊是哭啥mi̍h</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">上驚目一下nih</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">已經</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">無tī</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large;\">阮ê身邊</span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><br /></div><span><a name='more'></a></span><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhJ81eY5F-apLFPoNvdor_4sOkmQ8mA7ITNwd93RY_Lq_tYf2NofjY5j5f6Yx1he88T88ZlNXhBZbJ8jvII_dbkPeGtwf-KpSisdfZTUoRfrx8tiuiuyfCYMnt_cywCYpABwQ6sdjmXUdeamV9vaAhMR7P4wg6GnD0ZmW9-sM4ncxvGllnpxJQcZ7DTUW7k/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1352%E6%9C%9F_4.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhJ81eY5F-apLFPoNvdor_4sOkmQ8mA7ITNwd93RY_Lq_tYf2NofjY5j5f6Yx1he88T88ZlNXhBZbJ8jvII_dbkPeGtwf-KpSisdfZTUoRfrx8tiuiuyfCYMnt_cywCYpABwQ6sdjmXUdeamV9vaAhMR7P4wg6GnD0ZmW9-